        "What's in the unit today — any After/Wants/Requires at all, Type=, Restart= policy, timeouts?",
        "Is the two-minutes-later cron start reliable at 100%? (If yes, the missing precondition is ready within ~2 min — that bounds the search.)",
        "3 of 5 reboots — is the flakiness correlated with which boots were cold vs warm, or with parallel service load?",
