        "Fix the unit with correct dependency and ordering declarations, or an explicit readiness check, such that boot succeeds 20 of 20 test reboots.",
        "Remove the cron workaround and any Restart-band-aids that mask ordering truth.",
        "Handle the genuinely-async dependency (remote DB) with a supported pattern: retry-in-app, ExecStartPre wait loop with timeout, or Restart=on-failure with rate limiting — chosen deliberately.",
